--- a/docs/monolith-page-migration.md
+++ b/docs/monolith-page-migration.md
@@ -0,0 +1,80 @@
+# Monolith page migration
+
+This document tracks replacement of the legacy authenticated interface. The shared shell and
+foundation apply to every route immediately; route content is then rebuilt one page at a time.
+
+## Definition of complete
+
+A route is `complete` only when:
+
+- its old presentation markup has been removed rather than wrapped;
+- it uses `Page`, `PageHeader`, `PageSection`, and shared Monolith primitives;
+- page, section, panel, card, dialog, and table headings are text-only;
+- business numbers use Geist Sans with tabular numerics;
+- no route-local font or theme rules remain;
+- all business behavior and RBAC are preserved;
+- light, night, and violet themes work at mobile, tablet, and desktop widths;
+- loading, empty, error, permission, validation, and populated states are verified.
+
+## Status
+
+| Order | Route family | Status | Notes |
+| ---: | --- | --- | --- |
+| 1 | `/dashboard` | in progress | Command-center content exists; typography and heading composition are being normalized. |
+| 2 | `/product-catalogue` | queued | Remove legacy technical-brochure canvas, duplicate header treatment, cyan/orange styles, and decorative heading icons. |
+| 3 | `/todo` and `/notifications` | queued | Personal operations flow. |
+| 4 | `/hrms/**` | queued | Directory, requests, tasks, files, travel, recruit, settings. |
+| 5 | `/attendance/**` | queued | Attendance command, punch, leave, OT, reports, timesheets, sync. |
+| 6 | `/ams/**` | queued | Appraisal, KPI, assets, cycles, criteria, slabs. |
+| 7 | `/crm/**` | queued | CRM workspace and detail flows. |
+| 8 | `/cha/**` | queued | Jobs, approvals, customers, expenses, reports, configuration. |
+| 9 | `/accounting/**` | queued | Lists, documents, journals, reports, banking, settings. |
+| 10 | `/communication/**` | queued | Mail, chat, calendar, drive, meetings, job spaces, settings. |
+| 11 | `/expense` and `/lms/**` | queued | Supporting modules. |
+| 12 | `/admin/**` and `/account/**` | queued | Administration and security. |
+
+## Route migration template
+
+Use this structure for each route:
+
+```tsx
+import {
+  Button,
+  Page,
+  PageHeader,
+  PageSection,
+  Panel,
+  SectionHeader,
+  StatCard,
+  StatGrid,
+} from "@/components/monolith";
+
+export default function ExamplePage() {
+  return (
+    <Page>
+      <PageHeader
+        eyebrow="Operations"
+        signal
+        title="Page title"
+        description="A concise explanation of this workspace."
+        actions={<Button>Primary action</Button>}
+      />
+
+      <PageSection>
+        <SectionHeader
+          eyebrow="Live overview"
+          title="Section title"
+          description="What this section contains and why it matters."
+        />
+        <StatGrid>
+          <StatCard label="Open jobs" value="24" helper="Three require attention" />
+        </StatGrid>
+      </PageSection>
+
+      <Panel>{/* route-specific business UI */}</Panel>
+    </Page>
+  );
+}
+```
+
+Do not add an icon prop to `PageHeader` or `SectionHeader`.
